{
  "sequence_id": "seq_864aaca43a3580bb",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The players stated that just before getting sick..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "RNG"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Wow,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "... they heard strange noises and voices."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "That's where this newspaper article from 30 years ago comes in!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Mr. Yoshida, a construction company employee, went missing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Construction company employee missing as a substitute"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "He was last seen here! At this school, during construction!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "at the time, Mr. Yoshida was in debt!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "He was even being targeted by loan sharks!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "which means ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Mr. Yoshida's body is buried at the rugby field!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "TA-DAH!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The commotion is a result of his lingering spirit! (Our theory!)"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T17",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T18",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "No ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It seems like ticks were the reason."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Zing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "TICKS a type of parasite. The tick-borne disease is no joke, so be careful!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "So what?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm such an idiot."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "As the occult research club, we're hypothesizing about the occult! It's a respectable club activity!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "This isn't some kid's game!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Stop spreading rumors!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The biggest problem here is..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "YUJ! ITA- DORI!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You're a member of the track-and- field team! Not the occult research club!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "This means the occult research club doesn't meet the three- member minimum!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T15",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Itadori!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T16",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "GR.R."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T17",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "But I wrote \"occult research club\" on the application."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T18",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I re- wrote it!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T19",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "!??"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Track-and- field coach Mr. Takagi!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Go ahead"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "ITADORI"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "We need you if we're to take over the country."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "This teacher is sketchier than the students."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Which side should I take?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Enough already! I said I'm not joining!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "No can do!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "No can do?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "However, I'm not a monster!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Let's make it a fair fight! On the field!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If I lose, I'll give up on you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "RrMBB"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T15",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "How- ever! If I win..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T16",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Say no more! I accept!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T17",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Isn't it against the rules to change the application?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T18",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What's with this rugby field?"
    }
  ],
